        "original_id": "fa1c58d5-ac37-5af3-bee2-befc6b9ae44e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steven Earl \"Steve\" Gaines\n- Organizations: Lynyrd Skynyrd\n- Products: LPs, \"That Smell\"\n- Events: Steve Gaines joining Lynyrd Skynyrd, Steve Gaines's death\n\nFacts:\n- In May 1976, Steven Earl \"Steve\" Gaines became a member of Lynyrd Skynyrd.\n- In 1977, Steven Earl \"Steve\" Gaines played guitar on the LP that included the song \"That Smell.\"\n- In October 1977, Steven Earl \"Steve\" Gaines died.\n- Steven Earl \"Steve\" Gaines remained a member of Lynyrd Skynyrd from May 1976 until his death in October 1977.",
